---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTAButton from '../components/CTAButton.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us"
  description="Meet Kyle and Stephanie, the couple behind Debt Relief Tracker — building the tool we wish we had on our own debt-free journey."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
    <div class="mt-12 space-y-8 text-slate-600">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">About us</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600">
        We're Kyle and Stephanie — and like a lot of people who use {SITE.name}, we're on our own
        journey out of debt.
      </p>
      <p>
        Kyle is a software developer, and Stephanie is a geotechnical engineer. We got married on
        May 16, 2026, and started combining our finances, our goals, and — like most newly married
        couples — our debt.
      </p>
      <p>
        We built {SITE.name} because we wanted a clear, honest picture of where we stood and a real
        plan to get to zero, without paying for another subscription or handing our financial data
        to a company we couldn't verify. So Kyle built it, we started using it ourselves, and we
        decided to open source it and offer it free to anyone else working toward the same thing.
      </p>
      <p>
        We're both strong Christians, and our faith shapes how we think about money, debt, and
        generosity — that's part of why you'll find a Bible verse about financial freedom at the
        bottom of every page on this site.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col items-start gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
      <CTAButton href={SITE.appUrl}>Start your own journey</CTAButton>
      <CTAButton href={SITE.repoUrl} variant="secondary">
        View the code
      </CTAButton>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
